    {
      "id": "tDhQOvPBN9xmHrk4-SIlN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3079.1743199607886,
      "y": 69.39181195669454,
      "width": 404.80084228515625,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1829179384,
      "version": 1304,
      "versionNonce": 1949994120,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784224019709,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "APIs (REST)\n- GET /v1/items?lat=20&long=10&page=1&limit=10\n  Response: items[]\n\n- POST /v1/carts\n  Body: items[]\n  Response: 200 success\n\n- POST /v1/orders\n  Body: cartId\n  Response: 200 success",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "APIs (REST)\n- GET /v1/items?lat=20&long=10&page=1&limit=10\n  Response: items[]\n\n- POST /v1/carts\n  Body: items[]\n  Response: 200 success\n\n- POST /v1/orders\n  Body: cartId\n  Response: 200 success",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dRnPhpdSzDk4JZsFu1FNu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2361.1948807724384,
      "y": 734.4335756404055,
      "width": 484.0010070800781,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3l",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 953182088,
      "version": 1959,
      "versionNonce": 1135347192,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784223814847,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Get Items\n- Get the list of nearby stores\n- get the store inventory\n\nMethod 1\n- Calculate the distance b/w user and store\nusing the co-ordinates, and fetch all nearby stores\n\nIssues:\n> if we have 20k stores, we need to scan all 20k stores\n\nMethod 2:\n- geoHash --> hash co-ordinates\n  geoHash(lat, long) --> 7xl12saqeg\n\nthe close co-ordinates have similar prefix of hash\n20k stores --> scan using geoHash --> 20 stores",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Get Items\n- Get the list of nearby stores\n- get the store inventory\n\nMethod 1\n- Calculate the distance b/w user and store\nusing the co-ordinates, and fetch all nearby stores\n\nIssues:\n> if we have 20k stores, we need to scan all 20k stores\n\nMethod 2:\n- geoHash --> hash co-ordinates\n  geoHash(lat, long) --> 7xl12saqeg\n\nthe close co-ordinates have similar prefix of hash\n20k stores --> scan using geoHash --> 20 stores",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "G-l-9ok6Sm5fqFbBhJVeS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2305.615163366755,
      "y": 1112.9286739111533,
      "width": 466.4009704589844,
      "height": 580,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3p",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 901215480,
      "version": 2880,
      "versionNonce": 784636152,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784224146036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Traffic Estimates\n\nDAU - 15 M\nMAU - 80 M\nItems - 1M\n\nPeak concurrent users ~ 3 - 4%\n~500k\n\nRead estimates\nopens app 4 times and reads gets 10 products per page\n15M * 4 * 10 = 600M (total read per day)\n\n600 * 10^6 / 10^5 = 600 * 10 = 6k rps\n\nconsider spikes -> 5 to 10 x ==> 6k * 10 = 600k QPS\n\nWrite Estimates\n- 1M Orders per day\n- 10^6 / 10^5 = 10 rps\nconsider spikes --> 50 rps for orders\n\nwhen order is placed, the inventory count decremets\n\n- on Avg, 1 user places 10 items per order\n  |-> update 10 inventories per order\n-> 50 * 10 = 500 qps for inventory update\n\nRead Heavy system",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Traffic Estimates\n\nDAU - 15 M\nMAU - 80 M\nItems - 1M\n\nPeak concurrent users ~ 3 - 4%\n~500k\n\nRead estimates\nopens app 4 times and reads gets 10 products per page\n15M * 4 * 10 = 600M (total read per day)\n\n600 * 10^6 / 10^5 = 600 * 10 = 6k rps\n\nconsider spikes -> 5 to 10 x ==> 6k * 10 = 600k QPS\n\nWrite Estimates\n- 1M Orders per day\n- 10^6 / 10^5 = 10 rps\nconsider spikes --> 50 rps for orders\n\nwhen order is placed, the inventory count decremets\n\n- on Avg, 1 user places 10 items per order\n  |-> update 10 inventories per order\n-> 50 * 10 = 500 qps for inventory update\n\nRead Heavy system",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "x5jDhD7kTDGyYxU5ouMuc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 804.96875,
      "y": 170,
      "width": 114.4000015258789,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
